/target
# .tog/ is half record, half cache. The two records `tog audit` reads are
# committed; everything else in there is machine-local. The `**/` matters:
# a monorepo has a .tog/ per subproject, and so does tests/fixtures/*.
# README.md has the table.
**/.tog/*
!**/.tog/closures/
!**/.tog/policy.toml
.venv
__pycache__/
